From 0732129c04ade3c9f1d537c780498fa6f65a9340 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: spaceDolph1n <tiagojsr1@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 1 Oct 2026 12:24:11 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] fix(sidebar): mark the host row, show the cursor only while
 focused

The row background followed the j/k cursor, which each window's sidebar
keeps on its own and only re-synced when an agent pane had focus. Coming
back to a window often lands on the sidebar pane, so the background sat on
a different agent than the bold host name.

Match the dashboard instead: current_row_bg marks the host row,
highlight_row_bg marks the cursor and only while the sidebar has focus.
Entering the host window resets the cursor to follow the host, and a stale
host keeps its bold name.
---
 src/command/sidebar/app.rs              |  46 ++++++++++-
 src/command/sidebar/template/context.rs |  13 ++-
 src/command/sidebar/ui.rs               | 105 +++++++++++++++++++-----
 3 files changed, 140 insertions(+), 24 deletions(-)

